            "review_title": "Review at Timo Hangout",
            "review_text": "Jonathan Seeyave\n4 contributions\n0\nDouble charged for an International Transfer\nOct 2022\nHello, \n\nI'm a Timo user and have an account. \n\nI made an international transfer to Timo and requested the sending bank to pay for ALL charges. The Sending bank charged $35 USD for the transfer (which was ridiculously high) which includes sender and receiver. \n\nTimo charged me $25 USD when it arrived in my account. Despite my numerous complaints, Timo state that charging me $25 USD is normal, despite sending bank supposedly paying ALL Charges. That's almost like daylight robbery. \nI am disappointed by this and of course, Timo will not pay back. \n\nAlso Timo don't even have Mastercard or Visa for their debit card which makes mobile payments extremely difficult. Napas is not enough.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 23, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
