            "review_title": "Review at Timo Hangout",
            "review_text": "Nhi L\n2 contributions\n0\nA cool combination: Digital bank and Hangout cafe!\nSep 2016 • Friends\nIt’s real, not virtual! Vietnam’s first Digital Bank has officially launched. It is a fully functional local bank account that has been designed to help people manage their finances easily and on the go. Timo is short for \"time + money.\" So every interaction with Timo is meant to be efficient and paperless. There are no queues or branches, instead you are greeted at Timo Hangout café for account opening with a complimentary drink. After that, you can deposit in their Cash Deposit Machine and enjoy immediately:\n- 24/7 access to your account on Mobile or Web browser\n- Fee free transfers to any bank in Vietnam, free withdrawals at 15,700 ATMs nationwide, and pay bills easily on the go\n- Up to 50% discount on a growing number list of privilege partners\n- 0% Foreign exchange fee MasterCard.\nWhat are you waiting for? Come by for a visit and sign up on the spot if you prefer.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 7, 2016",
