            "review_title": "Review at Timo Hangout",
            "review_text": "Ann Vo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam30 contributions\n0\nFor the first time ever, Vietnam has its first Digital Bank.\nJul 2016 • Business\nIt's possible to make retail banking hip and cool, and a Vietnamese start-up called Timo is out to prove this with a latte.\nTimo Hangout, it’s likely a place to hang out more than a bank office, where can even be an ideal place to meet friends or to work.\nOther benefits that Timo offers:\n- More than 15,700 ATMs to serve Timo debit cards free of charge.\n- Free transferring out from Timo account to any other Vietnam bank accounts.\n- Free coffee at first time come to take the Timo card\nAnd more than that. So it’s time to save your time and money to enjoy a better UX and better experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 30, 2016",
